55
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,879
Master!

56
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:29,399
Kid! Kid!

57
00:05:29,759 --> 00:05:30,360
Where's the toxicology report?

58
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,079
It's not out yet.

59
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,160
I saw...

60
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,120
