61
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,000
Xun,

62
00:05:37,680 --> 00:05:38,600
are you spinning a tale?

63
00:05:39,199 --> 00:05:40,199
You can't just make things up.

64
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:40,759
I...

65
00:05:41,199 --> 00:05:42,560
He was completely dead.

66
