71
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:50,120
He walked right out of the morgue!

72
00:05:50,319 --> 00:05:51,759
Fine, fine. Let's go to the hospital.

73
00:05:51,800 --> 00:05:52,199
Wait.

74
00:05:53,800 --> 00:05:54,439
Go to Li Mansion.

75
00:05:55,399 --> 00:05:56,319
To Li Mansion?

76
00:05:56,720 --> 00:05:57,120
Wait!

77
