81
00:06:46,319 --> 00:06:47,040
Enlarged knuckles.

82
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:48,439
The height matches.

83
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:51,120
But how could a corpse...

84
00:06:51,839 --> 00:06:53,040
...get here all by itself?

85
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:54,279
Chief.

86
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,079
So, did Benefactor Li...

87
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,240
