88
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:58,319
...or a natural one?

89
00:06:59,240 --> 00:07:00,399
This man died twice.

90
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:03,399
What should I put as the cause of death in the file?

91
00:07:05,439 --> 00:07:06,040
Jiang Huai,

92
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,519
